  `rkx-loop-core`; ordinary `/loop-*` commands are direct focused phase helpers
  unless the USER explicitly requests an RKX wave.
- Wave execution uses the caller-recorded `CURSOR` or explicitly authorized `API` path with scopes `CURSOR_SUBSCRIPTION` or `API_CREDENTIALS`. Mode routing uses `fact-slot`/`blueprint-scout` or `cursor-fact-slot`/`cursor-blueprint-scout`. Resolve roles
